    Pulmonary Function Tests Performed at IRC Islamabad
  </h1>

  <p style="color:var(--muted2);font-size:13px;">
    By Dr Jehangir Khan &amp; Dr Muhammad Israr |
    IRC Clinic, Saeed International Hospital, G-11 Markaz Islamabad |
    0343-1510025 |
